<title>SWEDEN: Autoliv to form J/V on 'smart airbags'.</title>
<headline>Autoliv to form J/V on 'smart airbags'.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's Autoliv said on Monday it would form a jointly owned company with Automotive Technolgies International Inc. (ATI) of Detroit to develop and produce ATI's patented ultrasound sensor for car airbags.</p>
</text>
